!
!  nx_copilot.tbr - put Copilot on the leftmost (docked) toolbar
!  Added by the DC2026AI project. Not a Siemens original file.
!
!  Keyword order is fixed by NX: TITLE, then VERSION, then DOCK.
!
!  Buttons referenced here already exist:
!    NX_SKILL_CONTROL_OPEN_COPILOT  - our working local-Copilot button
!                                     (definition in definitions_nx_control.btn)
!    UG_APP_COPILOT                 - built-in command, inert without the
!                                     Designcenter X entitlement
!
!  Enable: Tools -> Customize -> Toolbars -> tick "Copilot"
!          then drag it to the far left edge to dock it vertically.
!
TITLE  Copilot
VERSION 160
DOCK LEFT

BUTTON NX_SKILL_CONTROL_READ_DRAWING

BUTTON NX_SKILL_CONTROL_OPEN_COPILOT

BUTTON UG_APP_COPILOT

BUTTON NX_SKILL_CONTROL_REVIEW_PLAN
BUTTON NX_SKILL_CONTROL_START_BRIDGE
